Who is on the screen now?
My entire family is on the screen.
My mother and my father smile.
Mother says, "Maya, take care of yourself."
I say, "Yes mother, you too."
My sister Sofia and my brother Diego wave.
Diego asks, "When is your next call?"
I say, "Next Sunday!"
My sweet Lola barks again.
I say a loving goodbye to everyone.
My family says bye to me.
Finally, the call ends.
I close my laptop.
The laptop screen goes black.
Now my room is very quiet.
It is just me in the room.
I take one deep breath.
I miss my family a lot.
But now I feel good.
